/-- 38:A3 — the channel at the instance: `gcd(12, 14) = 2`, `gcd(12, 28) = 4`, `N(i) = i² = −1` — as the divisor
facts the kernel decides: `2 ∣ 12, 14` and no `d > 2` divides both; `4 ∣ 12, 28` and no `d > 4` divides both. -/
