/-- 38:C7, 38:C10, 38:X1 — the two faces at the instance: the angular face `12/232 = 3/58 = κ/S`, the temporal face
`12/464 = 3/116 = κ/(2S)`, their ratio `2`; the per-chronon rate `1/232` at `(13, 233)` and at `(5, 233)`. -/
theorem two_faces :
