      M2.smul l ((borel a1 b1 e1).mul (boost ν α1 β1)) = (borel a2 b2 e2).mul (boost ν α2 β2) →
      α1 * β2 = α2 * β1 ∧ e2 * a1 = e1 * a2 ∧ e2 * b1 = e1 * b2) ∧
