  for every `n`, since `ω̄ ω = 1`. Its determinant is `ωⁿ`, which is one exactly when `3 ∣ n`, so `n = 3` is the least
  rank whose special unitary group holds the triality scalar. At `n = 3` the scalar `ω I₃` lies in `SU(H)` for every
