/-- p05024 — 5:D8. Finiteness of determinate totalities: in ZF with every infinite set Dedekind-infinite, a structure satisfies Det iff it is finite --- finite: the full higher-order theory decided by exhaustive evaluation; infinite: a copy of $\N$ inside gives an effective reduction of true second-order arithmetic, which is not arithmetical. The real field's first-order tameness is silence about its subsets. -/
